// We don't create the AudioContext at import time: browsers leave it
// "suspended" if created without a user gesture, and sometimes don't resume
// it properly. Instead we use a Proxy that instantiates the real context on
// first access (lazy) and delegates all properties/methods. The existing
// code keeps using `actx` as before, unchanged.

